# Commit after each turn (required)

If this turn changed durable files in this git repo, **commit before ending**. Do not wait for the user to ask.

## Commit

- Product, ops, docs, agent-knowledge files (`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `WISHLIST.md`, `MISTAKES.md`, Cursor rules/hooks)

## Skip / ask first

- Secrets (`.env`, credentials, MCP JSON with tokens)
- Throwaway debug (`127.0.0.1` ingest logs, `#region agent log`)
- Other-agent dirty trees, binaries, `node_modules`, `__pycache__`, generated `version.ts` unless the task owns them

Global Cursor rule: `~/.cursor/rules/commit-after-turn.mdc`
